      "name": "Penguin's Drug Collectables for 3.11.x",
      "slug": "penguins-drug-collectables-for-311x",
      "teaser": "Brand New Drug Items To Find And Sell! - DISCLAMER - (I don't support the actual use of drugs, this was just a mod idea i used as a basis for learning items)",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2981.png",
      "downloads": 3074,
      "favourites_count": 2,
      "description": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1900-penguin-s-drug-collectables/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Original mod</a> for 3.8 by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/52435-mrpenguin5292/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MrPenguin5292</a>; <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2486-penguin-s-drug-collectables-for-3-9-x/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">updated version</a> for 3.9 by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/31440-itsreapergirl/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ItsReaperGirl</a>. I take no credit for this mod, as even the bundle updates I just ran through the illustrious <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">grooveypenguinx’s</a> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/GrooveypenguinX/WTT-BundleMaster\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bundle Master</a>. Minimally tested, was able to load assets in game that were otherwise using the default pink missing texture shader.</p>\n<h3><strong>PROOF OF PERMISSION</strong></h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/9708-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" alt=\"9708-pasted-from-clipboard-png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>~ Intro ~</strong></p>\n<p>- DISCLAMER -</p>\n<p>(I don’t support the actual use of drugs, this was just a mod idea i used as a basis for learning items)</p>\n<p>Due to the nature of the mod and since i would like to remake this, no new stuff will be added in the future and only will receive bug fixes and ver updates!</p>\n<p>ICON MADE BY NICK</p>\n<p><em><strong>﻿~ ﻿Included in this mod ~</strong></em></p>\n<p>6 New Drug Items To Collect And Sell</p>\n<p>Baggies</p>\n<p>Bricks</p>\n<p>And a TUB!</p>\n<p><em><strong>~ Found In ~</strong></em></p>\n<p>Dead Scav Spawns</p>\n<p>Safes</p>\n<p>Medical Supply Crates</p>\n<p>Caches</p>\n<p><em><strong>~ Item Sell Values ~</strong></em></p>\n<p>Weed Baggie - 25k</p>\n<p>Meth Baggie - 50k</p>\n<p>Coke Baggie - 75k</p>\n<p>Weed Brick - 125k</p>\n<p>Meth Tub - 150k</p>\n<p>Coke Brick - 175k</p>\n<p><em><strong>~ Known Issues ~</strong></em></p>\n<p>Bad Models And Specs</p>\n<p><strong>~ Screenies ~</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DVsYmBn/Capture.png\" alt=\"Capture.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GMXgj5C/image.webp\" alt=\"image.webp\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/sp7vH5L/image.webp\" alt=\"image.webp\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How to Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract Penguin’s Drugs.7z into your SPT game folder.</p>\n<p>DrakiaXYZ’s gif for installing a mod:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Support Penguin</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292</a></p>\n<p>(This is not needed, but it helps keep the train going!)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/ZQndYO4NwBcAAAAC/gojo-satoru.gif\" alt=\"gojo-satoru.gif\" /></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/25352-tron/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tron</a>- Helping through all my questions - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveypenguinX</a>- Framework and tons of help <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/29815-pettan/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pettan</a>- Helping me a ton with questions and giving me better ways to do stuff<br />\nWTT Server For All The Help - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/YF2d5cxqQB\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.gg/YF2d5cxqQB</a>{.endtabset}</p></div></div></div>\n",
